  "title": {
    "rendered": "Cookie Policy"
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"585\" class=\"elementor elementor-585\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2c36917 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"2c36917\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b97a744 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"b97a744\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"></div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4f7701b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"4f7701b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Cookie Policy</h1>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ac6e00b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"ac6e00b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">What Are Cookies?</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-752cf92 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"752cf92\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"KrBgDCJfHYWjiY\"><div class=\"uilHrMFcZTKnuh\"><div class=\"ak-renderer-wrapper is-full-width css-1jke4yk\"><div class=\"css-p38xzc\"><div class=\"ak-renderer-document\"><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"25\">Cookies are small text files that are placed on your device when you visit a website. They help the website recognize your device and store information about your preferences and actions. We also use similar technologies such as pixels and local storage (collectively, &#8220;cookies&#8221;).</p></div></div></div></div></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4d8094c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"4d8094c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">How We Use Cookies</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-34e756a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"34e756a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"KrBgDCJfHYWjiY\"><div class=\"uilHrMFcZTKnuh\"><div class=\"ak-renderer-wrapper is-full-width css-1jke4yk\"><div class=\"css-p38xzc\"><div class=\"ak-renderer-document\"><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"25\">We use cookies on <a href=\"https://lorenmichaelsharris.com/\">Loren Michaels Harris</a> to:<br />• Enable basic functionality of the Website<br />• Remember your preferences and settings<br />• Analyze Website traffic and usage<br />• Improve our content, features, and Services<br />• Support our marketing and advertising efforts (where applicable)</p></div></div></div></div></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b72985b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"b72985b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Types of Cookies We Use</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-51d878e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"51d878e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"KrBgDCJfHYWjiY\"><div class=\"uilHrMFcZTKnuh\"><div class=\"ak-renderer-wrapper is-full-width css-1jke4yk\"><div class=\"css-p38xzc\"><div class=\"ak-renderer-document\"><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"608\"><strong>The types of cookies we may use include:</strong></p><p>Strictly necessary cookies: Essential for the Website to function properly (e.g., security, page navigation). Without these cookies, the Website may not work correctly.</p><p>Performance/analytics cookies: Help us understand how visitors interact with the Website, such as which pages are visited most often and how users move through the site. We use this information to improve the Website.</p><p>Functional cookies: Remember choices you make (such as language preferences) to enhance your experience.</p><p>Advertising/targeting cookies (if used): May be used by third-party partners or us to deliver relevant advertisements and track the effectiveness of marketing campaigns. Where required by law, we will ask for your consent before using these cookies.</p></div></div></div></div></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ed56c3e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"ed56c3e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Third-Party Cookies</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b426072 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b426072\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"KrBgDCJfHYWjiY\"><div class=\"uilHrMFcZTKnuh\"><div class=\"ak-renderer-wrapper is-full-width css-1jke4yk\"><div class=\"css-p38xzc\"><div class=\"ak-renderer-document\"><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"1432\">We may use third-party services that set cookies on our Website, such as:<br />• Analytics providers (e.g., to help us understand Website usage)<br />• Advertising networks<br />• Social media platforms</p><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"1643\">These third parties have their own privacy and cookie policies, which we encourage you to review.</p></div></div></div></div></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d6016d8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"d6016d8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Cookie Consent</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b925589 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b925589\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"KrBgDCJfHYWjiY\"><div class=\"uilHrMFcZTKnuh\"><div class=\"ak-renderer-wrapper is-full-width css-1jke4yk\"><div class=\"css-p38xzc\"><div class=\"ak-renderer-document\"><p data-renderer-start-pos=\"1432\">Where required by law, we will display a cookie banner or notice when you first visit the Website to obtain your consent for non-essential cookies. You can update your cookie preferences at any time via the options provided in the banner (if available) or by changing your browser settings.</p></div></div></div></div></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0fe28fe elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"0fe28fe\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Managing Cookies</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-93c6c49 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"93c6c49\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"KrBgDCJfHYWjiY\"><div class=\"uilHrMFcZTKnuh\"><div class=\"ak-renderer-wrapper is-full-width css-1jke4yk\"><div class=\"css-p38xzc\"><div class=\"ak-renderer-document\"><p>Most web browsers allow you to control cookies through their settings. You can:<br data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"hardBreak\" data-prosemirror-node-inline=\"true\" />• Block all cookies<br data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"hardBreak\" data-prosemirror-node-inline=\"true\" />• Block cookies from specific sites<br data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"hardBreak\" data-prosemirror-node-inline=\"true\" />• Delete cookies when you close your browser</p><p>Please note that disabling or blocking certain cookies may affect the functionality of the Website and your user experience.</p><p>Changes to This Cookie Policy<br data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"hardBreak\" data-prosemirror-node-inline=\"true\" />We may update this Cookie Policy from time to time to reflect changes in our practices or legal requirements. The &#8220;Last updated&#8221; date at the top indicates the latest revision.</p></div></div></div></div></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4363213 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"4363213\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Contact</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ffc511e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ffc511e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"KrBgDCJfHYWjiY\"><div class=\"uilHrMFcZTKnuh\"><div class=\"ak-renderer-wrapper is-full-width css-1jke4yk\"><div class=\"css-p38xzc\"><div class=\"ak-renderer-document\"><p data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;orderedList&quot;,{&quot;order&quot;:1,&quot;localId&quot;:null},&quot;listItem&quot;,{&quot;localId&quot;:null}]\">If you have questions or concerns about our use of cookies, please contact:<br data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"hardBreak\" data-prosemirror-node-inline=\"true\" />• Email: <a href=\"mailto:hello@lorenmichaelsharris.com\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"mark\" data-prosemirror-mark-name=\"link\">hello@lorenmichaelsharris.com</a><br data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"hardBreak\" data-prosemirror-node-inline=\"true\" />• Alternate email: <a href=\"mailto:lorenmichaelsharris@gmail.com\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"mark\" data-prosemirror-mark-name=\"link\">lorenmichaelsharris@gmail.com</a></p></div></div></div></div></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fe9cb5c elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"fe9cb5c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"></div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t",
    "protected": false
  },
